{
  "name": "Abandoned Cart Recovery — Spring Boot + n8n",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Abandoned cart recovery\n\nThis workflow orchestrates the Spring Boot mesh. It does **not** own cart or order data.\n\n1. Every 5 min, ask **cart-service** for carts idle 30+ min.\n2. Re-check **order-service** before emailing.\n3. Not purchased → email #1, wait 24h, check again.\n4. Still not purchased → email #2 with a coupon.\n\n**State lives in cart-service** (`reminderStage`), so scheduled runs never double-send.\n\nUse `n8n/test-abandoned-cart.ps1` to seed a cart, then click **Execute workflow**.\n\n**On n8n Cloud:** `localhost` is not your PC. Replace the Config base URLs with public tunnel URLs — see `n8n/README.md` §2b.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-460, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Test mode\nDefault: every 5 min, 30 min abandonment window, 1440 min (24h) wait.\n\nFor a fast demo:\n- `olderThanMinutes` → `0`\n- `reminderDelayMinutes` → `1`\n\nThe test script already backdates the cart, so `30` works too.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Test mode",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [60, -300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "name": "cartServiceBaseUrl",
              "value": "http://localhost:8089",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "name": "orderServiceBaseUrl",
              "value": "http://localhost:8081",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "name": "userServiceBaseUrl",
              "value": "http://localhost:8087",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
              "name": "notificationServiceBaseUrl",
              "value": "http://localhost:8084",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
              "name": "olderThanMinutes",
              "value": 30,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
              "name": "limit",
              "value": 100,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
              "name": "reminderDelayMinutes",
              "value": 1440,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
              "name": "couponDiscountPercent",
              "value": 10,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
              "name": "fallbackEmail",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.cartServiceBaseUrl }}/api/v1/cart/internal/abandoned?olderThanMinutes={{ $('Config').first().json.olderThanMinutes }}&limit={{ $('Config').first().json.limit }}&stage=NONE",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Get Abandoned Carts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "carts",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Split Carts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [660, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.userServiceBaseUrl }}/api/v1/users/internal/{{ $json.userId }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Get Customer Contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [880, 0],
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const cart = $('Split Carts').item.json;\nconst contact = $json || {};\nconst config = $('Config').first().json;\nconst email = contact.email || config.fallbackEmail || '';\nconst emailEnabled = Boolean(email) && contact.emailNotifications !== false;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...cart,\n    email,\n    customerName: contact.fullName || 'there',\n    emailEnabled,\n  },\n};\n"
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Merge Cart + Customer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1100, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.orderServiceBaseUrl }}/api/v1/orders/customer/{{ $json.userId }}/purchased",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "productIds",
              "value": "={{ ($json.items || []).map(i => i.productId).join(',') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "since",
              "value": "={{ $json.updatedAt }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Check Order Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1320, 0],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.purchased }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "false",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Merge Cart + Customer').item.json.emailEnabled }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "IF Should Remind?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1540, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Stop - Already Purchased",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1780, -140]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const cart = $('Merge Cart + Customer').item.json;\nconst name = cart.customerName || 'there';\nconst itemList = (cart.items || [])\n  .map(i => `<li>${i.productName} × ${i.quantity}</li>`)\n  .join('');\n\nconst message = `<html><body style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f172a\">\n  <h2>Your cart is still waiting, ${name}!</h2>\n  <p>You left these items behind:</p>\n  <ul>${itemList}</ul>\n  <p><strong>Cart total: ₹${cart.grandTotal}</strong></p>\n  <p><a href=\"http://localhost:3000/cart\">Return to your cart</a></p>\n  <p style=\"color:#64748b;font-size:12px\">Already bought them? Ignore this email.</p>\n</body></html>`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    recipientId: cart.userId,\n    recipientEmail: cart.email,\n    customerName: name,\n    itemCount: cart.itemCount,\n    grandTotal: cart.grandTotal,\n    subject: `${name}, your cart is still waiting`,\n    message,\n    type: 'ABANDONED_CART_REMINDER',\n  },\n};\n"
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000a",
      "name": "Compose Reminder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1780, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.notificationServiceBaseUrl }}/api/v1/notifications/internal/send",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000b",
      "name": "Send Reminder Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2000, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.cartServiceBaseUrl }}/api/v1/cart/internal/{{ $('Compose Reminder').item.json.recipientId }}/reminder-state",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"stage\": \"REMINDED\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000c",
      "name": "Mark Reminder Sent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2220, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// Snapshot the cart before the Wait node so the resumed execution\n// does not depend on item pairing across the wait.\nconst cart = $('Merge Cart + Customer').item.json;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    userId: cart.userId,\n    items: cart.items || [],\n    updatedAt: cart.updatedAt,\n    email: cart.email,\n    customerName: cart.customerName || 'there',\n    itemCount: cart.itemCount,\n    grandTotal: cart.grandTotal,\n    emailEnabled: cart.emailEnabled === true,\n    reminderStage: 'REMINDED',\n  },\n};\n"
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "Prepare Wait",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2440, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ Number($('Config').first().json.reminderDelayMinutes) }}",
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000d",
      "name": "Wait 24h",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [2560, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.orderServiceBaseUrl }}/api/v1/orders/customer/{{ $json.userId }}/purchased",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "productIds",
              "value": "={{ ($json.items || []).map(i => i.productId).join(',') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "since",
              "value": "={{ $json.updatedAt }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000e",
      "name": "Check Order Status Again",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2780, 120],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// Re-attach the cart snapshot to the fresh purchase-check result.\nconst cart = $('Prepare Wait').item.json;\nconst check = $json || {};\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...cart,\n    purchased: check.purchased === true,\n    matchedOrderId: check.matchedOrderId || null,\n  },\n};\n"
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "name": "Attach Cart After Wait",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [3000, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.purchased }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000f",
      "name": "IF Purchased After Wait?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [3220, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Stop - Purchased After Reminder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [3460, -40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const cart = $json;\nconst discount = $('Config').first().json.couponDiscountPercent;\nconst code = 'CART' + discount + '-' + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8).toUpperCase();\nconst name = cart.customerName || 'there';\n\nconst message = `<html><body style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f172a\">\n  <h2>Still thinking it over, ${name}?</h2>\n  <p>Here is <strong>${discount}% off</strong> the items in your cart.</p>\n  <p>Use coupon code:</p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:22px;letter-spacing:3px\"><strong>${code}</strong></p>\n  <p><a href=\"http://localhost:3000/cart\">Complete your order</a></p>\n  <p style=\"color:#64748b;font-size:12px\">This code is for this demo store only.</p>\n</body></html>`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    recipientId: cart.userId,\n    recipientEmail: cart.email,\n    subject: `${discount}% off the items in your cart`,\n    message,\n    type: 'ABANDONED_CART_COUPON',\n    couponCode: code,\n  },\n};\n"
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Build Coupon Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [3460, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.notificationServiceBaseUrl }}/api/v1/notifications/internal/send",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Send Coupon Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [3680, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.cartServiceBaseUrl }}/api/v1/cart/internal/{{ $('Build Coupon Email').item.json.recipientId }}/reminder-state",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"stage\": \"COUPON_SENT\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Mark Coupon Sent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [3900, 220]
    }
  ],
